Every clinician should pursue a toxicology-testing-bias-minimization.
Every clinical-practice-organization should pursue a toxicology-testing-bias-minimization.
Every health-system should pursue a toxicology-testing-bias-minimization.
If a clinician has an assumption about a patient then the clinician should not differentially apply a toxicology-testing-recommendation to the patient.
If a clinical-practice-organization has an assumption about a patient then the clinical-practice-organization should not differentially apply a toxicology-testing-recommendation to the patient.
If a health-system has an assumption about a patient then the health-system should not differentially apply a toxicology-testing-recommendation to the patient.
